Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't they flee\Nsouth where it is clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amayori, wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should the enemy breach our defenses,\Nyou must hold them back. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand your ground and keep\Nthose things out of our village!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will surround you if you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have everyone evacuate by the South\NRoad while you still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mansion...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this village is our home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can be rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you stay, you will\Nsurely be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is more important, your\Npossessions or your lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must stay because it is what\NZink, our man-at-arms, ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this situation, everyone\Nmust do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I, the village elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial law is clear on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should do as my sister says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know she speaks the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lives are more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we have to follow\Nthe laws of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay, we die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't abandon our homes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a child and you\Nshould mind your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will stay and protect the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your doing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things from the Dark Territory\Nwouldn't be here if not for you, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years ago, when you were a child and\Ntrespassed onto their land, you were tainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is in league with the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a knight, and I revoke\Nthe man-at-arms order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will all evacuate the village\Nby the south road, at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those of you bearing\Nweapons shall take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot be a knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no calling for them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can handle a sword reasonably well,\Nbut claiming to be a knight is outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if a knight from Senator heard this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am one of the three\Nknights who oversee Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Integrity Knight of the\NChurch, Alice Synthesis 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an Integrity Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In truth, I was afraid to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The knighthood is both my duty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my punishment, I knew you\Nweren't a sinner deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I always believed in you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will do as the Lady Knight commands
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall evacuate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those bearing weapons\Nwill lead the villagers to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,south gate at once as soon as\Neveryone is out evacuate to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forest south of the clearing\Ni need help with the wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the elderly right behind\Nyou hey you over there follow us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep them safe, Father, Selka and Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone yes m 'lady be safe as well
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be careful don't get yourself hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amayori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's way too many. Fall back! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll burn everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice has a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow the others to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you and eat\Nyour guts, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this moment on, I fight for\Nthat which is important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the lives of my sister and parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fight for the sake of what Kirito\Nand Eugeo sacrificed everything for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I may still falter,\Nmy purpose is crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall persevere for\Nthe sake of our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I live, the human\Nrealm will not fall to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to your homeland now, or\Nyou will die where you stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance Armaments!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forward, you stupid-yoon girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I work on the foot-harvester,\Nand your bone hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Storm and churn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End Mountains separate our lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dig through it if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as long as we knights exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are not to set foot here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your choice. Step\Nforward and drown in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your blood or retreat\Nto your land of darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a new doll. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father wanted to come see you off, but\Nwith the repairs, no. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, when I have fulfilled my duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will return, not as a\Nknight, but as Alice Zuburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps then I shall be able to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have come home, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will return to this village someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if I fall in\Nbattle, I know my heart will.
