Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I patched into the backup power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The subcons up and running\Nand ready for action now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better pray Kirito wakes up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if he doesn't, I\Nswear I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do everything I can\Nto bring him back. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this isn't the way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just overreacted there for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The primary and secondary\Nbulkheads are sealed and secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, all non-combat personnel have\Nbeen evacuated to the bow block.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About how long will the bulkheads hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.61,0:13:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they have saws, eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few minutes if they have explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they won't go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on the primary, Bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too close to the Lightcube Cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see where we stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Casualties first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me everyone's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three civvies with the research\Nteam sustained minor injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for our SDF unit, it's suffered\Ntwo minor and two heavy injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing life-threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're being treated now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bulkheads from the\Nbilge dock to main control
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are offline and can't\Nbe accessed remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the real issue is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main line was cut, so\Nwe're on auxiliary now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good news is we have stable\Npower all through the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bad news is we can't rotate the screw\Nprops without rebooting the whole system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a sea turtle without fins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a shark nipping at its belly,\Nyes, they got the bilge dock and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12 sectors in the lower shaft the\Nbastards they got us good they did
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right they have main control
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stl-1 and the nuclear reactor they
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want to destroy us if they\Ndid they would have blown us out of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the water by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next question is, who\Nthe hell are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, let's have a look-see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going by their suits and the hardware\Nthey're packing, I'd say they were mercs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And based on
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their average size, I'm\Npretty sure they're not Asian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least For not being\Nattacked by our own special
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forces, which is a relief\Nwe can also be sure of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one other thing whoever\Nthese people are they know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about project alicization\Nyep you got that right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they broke in through the bilge deck and\Nheaded straight for the main control room
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they know about the stl\Nand they know we have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a true bottom-up ai they're here for alice
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I locked down Main\NControl in time. I fixed it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can't interfere with the\Nsimulation or eject alice's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fluctlight from the light\Ncube cluster that's fantastic
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then neither can we. No, we\Ncan't. No one can eject Alice's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,light cube externally either\Nthem in main or us in here but
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's a good thing i mean\Nit's pretty much a win for our
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Side, they can't access the\Ncluster by computer and they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,break through the wall because\Nthey know they'll damage it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time till the asahi\Ncomes with backup then it's game over
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for those dumb asses game over but we\Nstill don't know if we're playing the game
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're getting played\Nhuh we're here where's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the asahi waiting sir the fleet commanding
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:17:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokosuka ordered her to keep her distance\Nand stand by until further notice. They
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem to think we've been taken hostage\Nand are sitting tight until the attackers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make their demands here's what i think\Nour guests have to have a back channel to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone high up in the sdf and if i'm\Nright the asahi won't move in until alice's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,light cube has been retrieved well now we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know we're not dealing\Nwith terrorists here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If these guys are what I think they\Nare, they'll have an expert with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who might realize they can eject\Nthe cube from inside the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since they have control of STL-1,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can drop someone in and use the\NVirtual Console to execute the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they do that, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The target cube will be\Nextracted from the Light
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.18,0:17:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cube cluster in the\Ncenter of the main shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, it'll be sent through an air tube\Nto a hatch in the selected control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hatch for this room's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other's in main con.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that we know what they want,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to retrieve Alice's\NFluctlight before they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.52,0:18:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, that's up to Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, all our hopes\Nare riding on his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, how is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his status currently?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the short version is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's stable now, but he's\Non the edge of not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That death gun dude's toxin\Ndamaged Kirito's neural network,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's not something\Nconventional treatment can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought the STL could stimulate\Nthe growth of a new network,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we blocked his memory and\Ndropped him into the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time, his memory didn't get blocked,\Nprobably because of the neural damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He woke up in there as\Nhis real-world self,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we didn't find out until he called us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's accelerated in the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much time has passed\Nin there since he dove in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About two and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's been interacting with the artificial\NFluctlights like they were real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He also knew that once\Nthe simulation ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his new friends and their\Nworld would be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he went to the\Nconsole in the Central Cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since that was the only\Nway to get a hold of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or rather, Akihiko here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he was going to try to convince\Nyou to spare them and their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to fight like hell\Nto get to that console,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he made it, thanks to some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't check the event log\Nduring all the commotion here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his friends helped him in\Nthe fight with Axiom Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he got through to us,\Nhe was in mental distress,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blaming himself for the\Ndeath of his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:20:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by doing that, he ended up\Nattacking his own Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was right about then when those\Njackasses cut the power line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That caused a short circuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.78,0:20:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the surge from that caused\Na spike in the STL's output.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, Kirito's self-destructive\Nimpulse was actualized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, his ego was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His ego was deactivated?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look at the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito's Fluctlight, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that black hole right there is\Nwhere a person's self-image should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The self-image?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea, concept, or\Nmental image of oneself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of your decision-making passes through
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a simple yes-no pathway\Nin your Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It asks whether you should\Nor shouldn't do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,based on whatever situation you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kojiro, when you're at your fave beef bowl\Nplace, you ever order a second helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.04,0:21:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if in your mind you're like, damn,\Nthis is good, I could eat another bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's your self-image\Npathway at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decisions can't lead to actions\Nunless they go through those circuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Kirito's case, his Fluctlight\Nis damaged in that one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't process what happens around\Nhim and he can't initiate an action.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he can do, I think, is stuff\Nhe remembers from repetition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating, sleeping, stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I don't think he knows\Nwho he is or what he should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he can't speak, so\Nhe can't ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's just my theory.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.28,0:21:53.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&HF9FEFE&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.79,0:21:56.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.81,0:22:00.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFAFAFA&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.97,0:22:06.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.38,0:22:13.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\blur0.5\c&H372317&}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sad that it's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so sad that it's so sad.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.81,0:22:18.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H342517&}So bright that they hurt deep inside to look at now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't live alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.63,0:22:26.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H51504A&\t(5338,5963,\c&H725C5E&)}If I was capable of living life all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to love me?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.68,0:22:34.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H23241A&}I never would have loved in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much I can do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.60,0:22:39.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H351405&\t(610,1903,\c&H5B3445&)}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your story.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.75,0:22:43.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H2C1428&}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my body.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.79,0:22:51.47,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H5A3E4A&}Pieces of love still linger all over my body
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.26,0:22:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.47,0:23:00.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H3F2930&}My only wish, my only wish is
Dialogue: 4,0:23:00.65,0:23:08.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}May you, wherever you are now,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}Be crying too
Dialogue: 4,0:23:09.70,0:23:12.60,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFEFEFE&}Be crying too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die.
